/home  Goes home.  command
/new  Goes home with the cursor in the input box.  command
/resume  Opens home at the session list.  command
/model  Opens the model picker.  command  █▀▀▀▀ █▀▀▀▄
/thinking [<level>]  Sets the thinking level, or opens the model picker on it.
/scoped-models  Chooses which models the model picker shows.  command
/tools  Opens the tools view.  command▀█  █▄▄▄▄ █   █ 0.0.1
/context  Opens the context breakdown.  command
